HARMONY TOWNSHIP, LARKIN COUNTY, PENNSYLVANIA
ORDINANCE NO. 2026-7

AN ORDINANCE OF THE TOWNSHIP OF HARMONY ESTABLISHING A TEMPORARY MORATORIUM ON DATA CENTERS.

Section 1. A moratorium is hereby imposed on the acceptance and processing of any application for a data center use within the Township for a period of six months from the effective date of this Ordinance.

ENACTED AND ORDAINED this 8th day of September, 2026, by the Board of Supervisors of Harmony Township.
